note as BIZ_diagram_50_marketing
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Multi-channel marketing on top of the CRM (module 49), the messaging fabric (module 35)
  and the loyalty/promotions engine (module 51). Defines audience segments, marketing
  campaigns and their members, multi-step journeys/flows with triggers and waits, reusable
  content templates, trackable UTM links, and multi-touch attribution. Ties campaigns to
  paid advertising (module 43 ads) and to promotions so spend, reach and conversions are
  measurable end to end. Consent-gated; no clinical PHI is used for targeting.
end note

