note as DEP_diagram_50_marketing
  Connects to other modules via:
  directory.tenants, iam.users, crm.contacts/leads (segment/campaign members),
  messaging.message_templates & notification_requests (delivery), ads.campaigns
  (ad_campaign_ref_id), promotions.promotions (promotion_id), read_models (segment source),
  consent.consents (marketing legal basis), terminology.catalog_concepts.
end note

note as PHI_BOUNDARY_diagram_50_marketing
  CONSENT-GATED, NO PHI. Segments/journeys target commercial contacts by id/reference, never
  by clinical condition. Marketing sends require an opt-in/consent; suppression honours
  crm.contacts.do_not_contact and messaging.recipient_preferences.
end note

note as REC_DERIVED_diagram_50_marketing
  REC 3.3 — DERIVED
  segments.estimated_size, tracked_links.click_count and campaign response rates are DERIVED
  counters (trigger/recompute). marketing_touchpoints is append-only; attribution_touches are
  computed from touchpoints per attribution_model and must sum weight=1 per conversion.
end note

note as HARDENING_diagram_50_marketing
  REC 3.4 — HARDENING (enforce at DDL)
  - segment_members / campaign_members: UNIQUE(segment_id|campaign_id, member_type_concept_id, member_ref_id).
  - journey_enrollments: partial UNIQUE(journey_id, member_type_concept_id, member_ref_id) WHERE status='active'.
  - tracked_links: UNIQUE(code); marketing_touchpoints: append-only, PARTITION BY recorded_at.
  - attribution_touches: trigger CHECK SUM(weight)=1 per (conversion_ref_type, conversion_ref_id).
  - polymorphic member_ref/conversion_ref -> value_set + trigger.
end note

note as VALUE_SETS_diagram_50_marketing
  VALUE SETS (bind *_concept_id; do not hardcode)
  segment_type->vs_segment_type{static,dynamic,imported,lookalike};
  member_type->vs_marketing_member{contact,lead,patient,user};
  campaign_type->vs_marketing_campaign_type{email,sms,whatsapp,push,ads,multichannel,event};
  objective->vs_marketing_objective{awareness,acquisition,retention,reactivation,upsell,referral};
  channel->vs_marketing_channel{email,sms,whatsapp,push,in_app,ads,web};
  member_status->vs_campaign_member_status{targeted,sent,delivered,opened,clicked,converted,bounced,unsubscribed};
  entry_trigger->vs_journey_trigger{segment_entry,event,date,manual,api};
  step_type->vs_journey_step{send,wait,branch,goal,update,exit,webhook};
  touch_type->vs_touch_type{impression,open,click,visit,conversion,reply};
  attribution_model->vs_attribution_model{first_touch,last_touch,linear,time_decay,position_based,data_driven};
  position->vs_touch_position{first,middle,last};
  conversion_ref_type->vs_conversion_ref{opportunity,enrollment,payment_intent,appointment_booking,order};
  status/state->vs_lifecycle_state.
end note


